      "writtenOn": "2025-02-05T22:37:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What happens if mistakenly `range_end` \u003c `range_start` is passed?\n\nOr if size is too large?\n\nAlso, what if there are too many files?\n\nFor the last 2 questions, I\u0027m guessing `memfd` would fail at creating the file so that would probably be fine, but the first question, what if it\u0027s a user error, or a swap between end/start? If the VM fails to start, that\u0027s fine then, but if the VM starts, what would be the behavior?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1367,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 1367,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "3110e10386e8f92dd9d0d4640f48cd3743a905d1",
