      "writtenOn": "2025-02-06T23:25:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It isn\u0027t being validated right now. I think if the file is too small, then an access to the extra part of the mmap from userspace will result in a SIGBUS. Probably something similar happens if the guest or hypervisor does the same.\n\nAdding a length check is easy ofc, but if we want to be completely sure, we should require the memfd to be sealed so it can\u0027t be resized after the check is done.",
